        "text": "Writing secure code\nMost code has security flaws; it is our job to make sure that the code we write is as secure as possible.\nIn this section, we will look at some ways to write more secure PowerShell code. We\u2019ll look at how to\nstore passwords our scripts might need, code signing scripts, and parameter validation.\nEsta secci\u00f3n contiene las siguientes subsecciones\n\u2022 Storing passwords securely\n\u2022 Signing scripts\n\u2022 Parameter security\nSi deseas explorar cualquiera de estas subsecciones, puedes pregunt\u00e1rmelo directamente.",
